  "details": "VRCat and VRRat are experiencing significant and unnecessary FOMO as they appear to be counting \"online users\" including those on the website, not just in-game users. While I would love to be able to throw snowflakes onto my friends' desktops, this seems inaccurate. Please send them both back to school ASAP.\n\nTo reproduce:\n\n1. Have some friends, some in game, some on the website\n\n2. Add the VRChat Android desktop widget\n\n3. Listen to the mournful meowing/squeaking as they incorrectly add in-game and on-website users together\n\nIn the attached widget screenshot, only about 7 friends are actually online and in-game.\n\nAdded a screenshot of my build number as Firefox Mobile won't let me enter alphanumerics into the Build Number box below.",
